                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/releases/tag/v0.3.228"&gt;v0.3.228&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BuildTask mode should not generate types from InternalsVisibleTo referenced assemblies by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jevansaks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jevansaks"&gt;@jevansaks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3528186834" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1492" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1492/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1492"&gt;#1492&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CsWin32 build task fixes for NET8/CSharp12 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jevansaks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jevansaks"&gt;@jevansaks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3534402667" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1498" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1498/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1498"&gt;#1498&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix platform case sensitivity issue with CsWin32Generator tool by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jevansaks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jevansaks"&gt;@jevansaks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3534906855" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1499" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1499/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1499"&gt;#1499&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update documentation for CsWin32RunAsBuildTask mode by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jevansaks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jevansaks"&gt;@jevansaks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3534398451" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1497" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1497/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1497"&gt;#1497&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ArrayPool can be larger than requested resulting in freeing uninitialized GCHandles by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jlaanstra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jlaanstra"&gt;@jlaanstra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3032940854" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1405" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1405/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1405"&gt;#1405&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix analyzer test break in devdiv AzDO account by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/AArnott/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/AArnott"&gt;@AArnott&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3538919188" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/issues/1504" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1504/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/CsWin32/pull/1504"&gt;#1504&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
